# Aethel Engine — Cursor/Claude Rules (V33)

## Estrutura
- **Produto real:** `cloud-web-app/web/` (Next 14 App Router)
- **Desktop:** `apps/studio-local/` (Tauri 2 + Rust)
- **Código morto (NÃO TOCAR):** `src/`, `client/`, `lib/` raiz, `components/` raiz, `runtime-templates/`
- **Path alias:** `@/` → `cloud-web-app/web/`

## Decisão arquitetural V33
- Web: React Three Fiber (manter)
- Desktop: wgpu Rust nativo (a construir do zero, sem refletir o R3F)

## Stack canônico
- Next 14 App Router | React 18 | TypeScript strict
- Tailwind 4 + tokens `var(--aethel-*)`
- Monaco | xterm | Three/R3F/Drei | Yjs
- Zustand state | React Query | Prisma
- Logger: `createComponentLogger` (NUNCA console.log)

## Limites
- Componente: ≤ 500 LoC
- Sem PT-BR em UI (usar react-i18next)
- Sem hex colors em TSX (usar tokens)
- Sem `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` sem audit

## Quality gates pré-PR
```bash
cd cloud-web-app/web
npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run test
npm run qa:design-system-consistency
npm run qa:hardcoded-colors
npm run qa:button-types
```

## Arquivos canônicos importantes
- Physics: `lib/engine/physics-engine.ts` (TS) + `lib/physics-engine-real.ts` (Rapier) + `workers/physics-worker.ts`
- Render: `lib/aaa-render-system.ts` (Three.js, 1051 LoC)
- Ledger: `lib/production/task-evidence-ledger.ts` (NÃO `lib/ai/agent-run-ledger.ts`)
- Context: `lib/ai/deep-context-manager.ts` (78 LoC — expandir, é stub)
- WebSocket: `lib/server/websocket-server.ts` (1443 LoC — quebrar)
- ECS: `lib/ecs-dots-system.ts` (1055 LoC)
- Visual Script: `lib/visual-script/runtime.ts` (1087 LoC) + `components/visual-scripting/VisualScriptEditor.tsx` (689 LoC)
- Monaco: `components/editor/MonacoEditorPro.tsx` + `.actions.ts` + `.symbols.ts` + `.theme.ts` (não `.runtime.tsx` — não existe)

